# Digital Image Processing in Private Industry.

**Authors:** Moore, Connie

## Abstract
Examines various types of private industry optical disk installations in terms of business requirements for digital image systems in five areas: records management; transaction processing; engineering/manufacturing; information distribution; and office automation. Approaches for implementing image systems are addressed as well as key success factors. (Author/MBR)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ339170

